OL,3,GNEWSAA45 to close in December for HS2
OL,4,Aworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A45 Coventry Road is to close for
OL,7,Fpart of December as work continues to
OL,8,Fbuild a bridge over the HS2 rail line.
OL,10,FThe road will shut in both directions
OL,11,Fnear Bickenhill, Solihull, to allow a
OL,12,Fcontraflow to be set up using the
OL,13,Fsection of the bridge that has already
OL,14,Fbeen built.
OL,16,FWork will then continue on the second
OL,17,Fhalf of the bridge, with the remaining
OL,18,Flanes expected to be built over the
OL,19,Fnext year.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
