OL,3,GNEWSAA45 to close in December for HS2
OL,4,Aworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvernight closures will take place
OL,7,Fbetween 21:00 and 06:00 GMT each
OL,8,Fweeknight 7-11 December. The road will
OL,9,Falso be fully closed in both directions
OL,10,Ffrom 21:00 on 11 December until 06:00
OL,11,Fon 14 December. Further overnight
OL,12,Fclosures are then planned until
OL,13,FSaturday 19 December.
